WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:05.884
If an account has been emptied, here is what can and cannot be done, starting with the hard truth.

2
00:00:07.584 --> 00:00:09.660
A validated payment is final.

3
00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:14.312
Validators, Ripple, wallet makers and NOSHASHI cannot reverse it.

4
00:00:14.312 --> 00:00:20.683
Anyone offering to recover stolen X R P for a fee is running the second half of the scam.

5
00:00:22.383 --> 00:00:28.207
First, move anything left to a brand-new account created on a device that never held the old seed.

6
00:00:28.657 --> 00:00:34.225
Second, check whether the thief added their own regular key or signer list, so they can keep signing.

7
00:00:34.675 --> 00:00:36.765
Third, follow where the value went.

8
00:00:36.765 --> 00:00:38.259
Every movement is public.

9
00:00:38.709 --> 00:00:44.721
Fourth, report it to the police with the evidence: transaction hashes, amounts and times.

10
00:00:44.721 --> 00:00:47.626
In the United States that is I C 3 dot gov.

11
00:00:49.326 --> 00:00:57.838
If stolen value reached an exchange, the exchange can identify and freeze the deposit if reached quickly, usually with a police reference.

12
00:00:58.288 --> 00:01:04.069
A token's issuer can freeze stolen tokens, or claw them back, unless it has given that right up.

13
00:01:04.519 --> 00:01:08.613
And authorities can act when a trail reaches a sanctioned address.

14
00:01:08.613 --> 00:01:15.250
NOSHASHI's Incident Response follows the value hop by hop and writes a fingerprinted dossier for all three.
